sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant E as Effect
    participant API as Server
    U->>E: id = 1
    E->>API: fetch(1)
    U->>E: id = 2
    Note over E: cleanup runs: abort fetch 1
    E->>API: fetch(2)
    API-->>E: response 2
    Note over E: setState(data 2)
    API--xE: response 1 aborted or ignored
